'''Exhibit Encounter''' is a [[special]] card.  It first appeared in [[The Curse of the Dark Pharaoh (Revised Edition)]] [[expansion]].

When an [[investigator]] is in a [[street area]] with the [[Ancient Whispers marker]] during the [[Arkham Encounters Phase]], he draws a card from the Exhibit Encounter deck. It will describe an action the investigator needs to perform to gain an [[Exhibit Item]]. Once this is resolved, the Ancient Whispers marker is moved to the street area indicated at the bottom of the card.

